{"kind":"request","text":"DX-T4: manifest builders, typed projections, views and roles. Child of\nrequest 1761d819 (items 6c, 6d, 6e, 6h) under 99c4756a.\n\nType the rest of an application package from the definition value, so\nthe manifest's projections, views and grants are checked in the editor.\n\nWanted:\n1. A projection builder that derives each field's of and nullable rows\n   from the typed value; the author chooses items, states, limits and\n   which slots to read. The manifest copies the slot type verbatim\n   today and the binding refuses any difference, so deriving them\n   changes no bytes.\n2. Views typed from the projection: acts, needs, facts and template\n   names are checked in the editor, and when goes through the DX-T2\n   tagged template. Binding is unchanged.\n3. Roles declared first, and grant typed as the union of the declared\n   actions, so the package graph's ungranted-act is a compile error.\n4. Provenance: when a typed definition extends another (the spike's\n   due-date variant), compile emits the parent digest and the forms\n   added, for the package to carry later. Package derivation and\n   parameters stay unbuilt (read.ts assigns them to P5); this head\n   builds no second mechanism.\n5. Witnesses: the lending and Counter packages re-expressed with pins\n   and manifests unchanged; dap check and pack unchanged.\n\nThe scenario harness (DX-B2, 3770c687) is item 6f of 1761d819 and is\nalready filed. The kernel is unchanged. No pinned bytes change.","body":{"conditions":"After DX-T3 lands. One gate, exact-head checker review, PD-2 note with the witness.","target_head":"06e4d33fe17937610891f29b5d1513b9e224edea","target_ref":"refs/heads/main","target_repo":"git:sha1:589bca982736a2361d15d53f7572375ef2f7aaf3","to":"feb90d36627c7f4466ef9473c4fa0bbaf91699d16b93d832a37629988dfba6de"}}